     2	
     3	Feature #30 is the Phase 0.3 exit slice for a single synced entity: `todos`.
     4	
     5	## Implemented Local Core
     6	
     7	- `packages/plugin-account/src/todo-sync.ts` owns the todo sync store.
     8	- Local todo mutation writes the todo row and `sync_outbox` row through one
     9	  `SqliteDriver.transaction()` call.
    10	- Outbox rows are encoded as plaintext JSON until `pushBatch()` lazily encrypts
